WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.577
The integrated project uses a staging table with messy customer data.

00:00:04.577 --> 00:00:10.437
You will normalize text, parse supported date formats, rank duplicate candidates,

00:00:10.437 --> 00:00:12.942
and label records that need review.

00:00:12.942 --> 00:00:17.147
The objective is a transparent candidate-clean output.

00:00:17.147 --> 00:00:24.307
Unsupported or ambiguous values should remain visible as uncertainty rather than being guessed.

00:00:24.307 --> 00:00:32.197
A quarantine pattern separates questionable records from trusted analytical output without deleting evidence.

00:00:32.197 --> 00:00:39.372
Views are useful for reusable cleaning logic because they let you expose a consistent cleaned representation

00:00:39.372 --> 00:00:42.127
while keeping raw source data intact.

00:00:42.127 --> 00:00:45.758
That improves reproducibility and auditability.
